{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Preview","type":"heading","anchor":"Preview"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The preview image is generated by the CI render pipeline, never hand-committed:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"verify.yml","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" (","type":"text"},{"code":"pixel-gate","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" job) renders Origami’s artboard and SwamiHost’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"SwiftUI side-by-side at matching simulator dimensions.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"post-merge.yml","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" copies the SwamiHost render into","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"Resources\/Patterns\/Interaction_Drag.png","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" after a pattern lands on main.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"publish-docs.yml","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" picks up the committed PNG and includes it in the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"DocC archive published to GitHub Pages."}]}]}],"type":"orderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The artifact path is: "},{"code":"app\/Swami\/Swami.docc\/Resources\/Patterns\/Interaction_Drag.png","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_drag"]}],"kind":"article","schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"sections":[],"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"Swami"}],"role":"sampleCode","roleHeading":"Sample Code","title":"Interaction — Drag"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Drags a layer in any direction with momentum and rubber-band bounds. The draggable